      - CSL spec-content cross-referenceable from specs/*.csl
    stage-1+ : PRIME_DIRECTIVE.csl IS-a-CSSL-source-file compiled-by-csslc-itself · meta-circular self-host
    invariant : ONE source · multiple derivations · zero-drift-by-construction · spec-and-code coherence-enforced-at-build

  TOPOLOGY-INVARIANT : T enforced UNIFORMLY across compile-time AND runtime · SAME prohibitions · SAME principals · SAME banned-compositions

§§ ⟨6 LoA-alignment⟩

